# API Development Workflow

## Local dev

```bash
pnpm --filter @my-barber/api dev
cp .env.example .env.development   # from backend/api/
```

## Scripts (via pnpm filter or package dir)

- `dev` — hot reload
- `build` — TypeScript → `dist/`
- `test` — Jest suite
- `lint` — ESLint

## Environments

- Dev + staging → staging Firebase project
- Production → production Firebase project
- Domains: `api.my-barber.uz`, `staging-api.my-barber.uz`

## Verification

```bash
pnpm turbo run typecheck lint test --filter=@my-barber/api
node scripts/generate-swagger.js   # before committing route changes
```

Monorepo-wide rules: `.cursor/rules/monorepo-core.mdc`
